爲牧丘侯。」是時漢方南誅兩越，東撃朝鮮，北逐匈奴，西伐大宛，中國多事。天子巡狩海内，修上古神祠，封禪，興禮樂。公家用少，桑弘羊等致利，王温舒之屬峻法，兒寬等推文學至九卿，更進用事，事不關決於丞相，丞相醇謹而已。在位九歳，無能有所匡言。嘗欲請治上近臣所忠、九卿咸宣罪，不能服，反受其過，贖罪。"}],"rationale":"依本篇姓名、稱號、名歐及名仁等明示與敘事承接判讀；來源原字保留，未自動跨篇同名合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p011","text":"元鼎五年秋，丞相有罪，罷。制詔御史：「萬石君先帝尊之，子孫孝，其以御史大夫慶爲丞相，封爲牧丘侯。」是時漢方南誅兩越，東撃朝鮮，北逐匈奴，西伐大宛，中國多事。天子巡狩海内，修上古神祠，封禪，興禮樂。公家用少，桑弘羊等致利，王温舒之屬峻法，兒寬等推文學至九卿，更進用事，事不關決於丞相，丞相醇謹而已。在位九歳，無能有所匡言。嘗欲請治上近臣所忠、九卿咸宣罪，不能服，反受其過，贖罪。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"z6g_h69_eva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"萬石君","kind":"person","person_id":"esh_e0a_jrw_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"慶","kind":"person","person_id":"esh_e0a_jrw_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"桑弘羊","kind":"person","person_id":"0r9_eg1_k8e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0110","start":110,"end":113,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"a54_d6h_wd1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"blw_xsu_w9q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0167","start":167,"end":169,"surface":"所忠","kind":"person","person_id":"lpm_cci_4wd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"咸宣","kind":"person","person_id":"oh2_xep_h3c","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","book_id":"b-shiji-103","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji